                                        "entry_id": "5edd35f1-9fa2-3454-bd96-bc344e99ff41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Redundant use of words, a pleonasm, an unnecessary and tedious repetition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47da9e10-67b1-4fa8-926f-8e0ccda100de",
                                                "sense_id": "795e78c0-f1ae-3cb8-a0f8-b86d7036aa79",
                                                "text": "It is tautology to say, \"Forward Planning\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9470173-8b27-3e9b-b73d-f072e247c751",
                                        "entry_id": "5edd35f1-9fa2-3454-bd96-bc344e99ff41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression that features tautology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da8b55d5-e8f2-4f6a-a0c4-c022bc1d445b",
                                                "sense_id": "b9470173-8b27-3e9b-b73d-f072e247c751",
                                                "text": "The expression \"raze to the ground\" is a tautology, since the word \"raze\" includes the notion \"to the ground\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29642916-92a8-48ff-8734-a53985a3eb63",
                                                "sense_id": "b9470173-8b27-3e9b-b73d-f072e247c751",
                                                "text": "Pure mathematics consists of tautologies, analogous to ‘men are men’, but usually more complicated."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2fed6b4-8a50-34d4-932c-972d19192f71",
                                        "entry_id": "5edd35f1-9fa2-3454-bd96-bc344e99ff41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement that is true for all truth values of its propositional variables."
